{"id":16073,"author":"Cyclops","body":"Most of this stuff probably wont be resolved until months from now, even if people repeat themselves, but yolo.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e- Remove AFK Timer\u003c/i\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThis is the most annoying thing possibly ever, I could be getting a god damn sandwich and Ill be kicked. Seriously, its not like someone's been there all day. Don't even higher the timer, just remove it.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eMASSIVE FUCKING SUG HERE- All rules should be enforced on scrimmage servers EXCEPT the following:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003eSections A5, A7, B2, B5, B6.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eIt is absolutely ridiculous that ALL of these rules are to be enforced on scrimmage servers, and the individual who thought of such of thing did not think straight whatsoever when announcing such an atrocious rule. Why in the world should SPAWN KILLING be enforced in a scrimmage, thinking that you will be able to do so in a god damn tourney, it really is the most stupidest thing I have ever feasted my eyes on. Seeing you should be practicing how to fend something off before the real deal shows up... I just don't understand.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe rest of the rules that should be allowed in a scrimmage server are pretty self-explanatory if you have a brain.\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e-\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e- Fix the block lag.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003eHow many times does a community have to repeat themselves for something so minor to be solved.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e- Allow scrimmage server reservations at any time.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhy do I have to wait 2 hours for a server to be open for me to reserve it? I could have been 5 seconds late past n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003eoon and now I have to wait 2 hours. Again, I don't understand.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e- Allow teleportation, and all members to have permissions on scrimmage servers.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhy the fuck don't all my members have permissions to cycle a map when I might not be around? If you use the excuse of \"MY TEAMMATES ARE TROLLS I JUST CANT DO IT\", piss off and control your members for god sake, you are a leader for a reason. If you cannot control your members, you either don't deserve to be a team leader, or the members don't deserve to be on the team.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003eTeleportation should be self-explanatory, again, if you have a brain.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e","body_tagged":"Most of this stuff probably wont be resolved until months from now, even if people repeat themselves, but yolo.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e- Remove AFK Timer\u003c/i\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eThis is the most annoying thing possibly ever, I could be getting a god damn sandwich and Ill be kicked. Seriously, its not like someone's been there all day. Don't even higher the timer, just remove it.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eMASSIVE FUCKING SUG HERE- All rules should be enforced on scrimmage servers EXCEPT the following:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003eSections A5, A7, B2, B5, B6.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eIt is absolutely ridiculous that ALL of these rules are to be enforced on scrimmage servers, and the individual who thought of such of thing did not think straight whatsoever when announcing such an atrocious rule. Why in the world should SPAWN KILLING be enforced in a scrimmage, thinking that you will be able to do so in a god damn tourney, it really is the most stupidest thing I have ever feasted my eyes on. Seeing you should be practicing how to fend something off before the real deal shows up... I just don't understand.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe rest of the rules that should be allowed in a scrimmage server are pretty self-explanatory if you have a brain.\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e-\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e- Fix the block lag.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003eHow many times does a community have to repeat themselves for something so minor to be solved.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e- Allow scrimmage server reservations at any time.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhy do I have to wait 2 hours for a server to be open for me to reserve it? I could have been 5 seconds late past n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003eoon and now I have to wait 2 hours. Again, I don't understand.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e- Allow teleportation, and all members to have permissions on scrimmage servers.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhy the fuck don't all my members have permissions to cycle a map when I might not be around? If you use the excuse of \"MY TEAMMATES ARE TROLLS I JUST CANT DO IT\", piss off and control your members for god sake, you are a leader for a reason. If you cannot control your members, you either don't deserve to be a team leader, or the members don't deserve to be on the team.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003eTeleportation should be self-explanatory, again, if you have a brain.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e","created_at":1440394554,"title":"Cyclops' Chunk Full List o Suggestions","replies":[{"id":222734,"author":"PokerFace","body":"I agree with pretty much all the stuff but if you remove the AFK timer, people could be on f